  "summary": "Species content flows from SpeciesRegistry (publication versions, variant snapshots) through SpeciesGrantLedgerBuilder into a pure materialization consumed by progression SpeciesBackgroundPlanBuilder, then ActorEngine. Mutations in the domain go through ActorEngine except an annotated fallback. Conformance gaps are moderate: the activated-ability engine posts 12 gameplay chat messages directly (A-05); the atomic species-replacement transaction for existing actors is only called from the orphan drop-handler, so it is not wired; the 715-line SpeciesTraitEngine and scripts/species/index.js are dead. Mechanical-responsibility leads (condition steps, ability modifier, rage damage, modifier aggregation) are delegations or distinct mechanics, not duplicate authorities. All species rules questions remain in the register (SPECIES-RD-001..023); none were decided.",
